  "version": "v5.5.56",
  "date": "2026-10-01",
  "body": "### New features/UI/Updates\n\n- Support SSH agent forward in bookmark/quick connect settings\n- AI: Support auto compress, chat context is now compressed automatically before it overflows the model's window\n- UX: Add context menu icon for touch device in session toolbar\n- Widget: Support widget instance detail and instance log\n- Widget FTP server: Add `pasv_url` option and proper `pasv_min`/`pasv_max` range\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- Fix binary trzsz transfer, downloaded files would be corrupted with protocol text spliced in\n- Fix non-ASCII text garbled in the session log (#4562) by @developerjillur\n- Fix session log keeping only the last row of long lines (#4496) (#4561) by @developerjillur\n- AI: Fix cancel request logic\n- AI: Fix AI chat input lagging issue\n- UI: Fix AI preset UI in mobile mode\n\n-----\n\n### 新功能/界面/更新\n\n- 书签/快速连接设置支持 SSH 代理转发（agent forward）\n- AI：支持自动压缩，上下文超出模型窗口前会自动压缩，避免请求被拒绝导致对话中断\n- 体验：会话工具栏在触屏设备上添加右键菜单图标\n- 组件：支持查看组件实例详情和实例日志\n- 组件 FTP 服务：新增 `pasv_url` 选项，并正确设置 `pasv_min`/`pasv_max` 端口范围\n\n### 问题修复\n\n- 修复二进制 trzsz 传输，下载的文件中会混入协议文本导致损坏\n- 修复会话日志中非 ASCII 文本乱码的问题 (#4562)（由 @developerjillur 提供）\n- 修复会话日志只保留长行最后一行的问题 (#4496) (#4561)（由 @developerjillur 提供）\n- AI：修复取消请求逻辑\n- AI：修复 AI 对话输入卡顿问题\n- 界面：修复移动端 AI 预设界面\n\n-------\n\nDownload下载: [https://electerm.org](https://electerm.org)\n",
